meta {
  name: Dashboard - Claim Getting Started Reward
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/:workspace/dashboard/getting-started/:milestone/claim
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  workspace: {{workspaceId}}
  milestone: run_workflow
}

docs {
  Pays a reached checklist milestone's credits into the workspace, once.
  `milestone` is one of `run_workflow` (20), `connect_app` (20),
  `activate_trigger` (30), `create_agent` (20), `invite_teammate` (50, paid
  once a teammate has joined). Rewards follow the free allowance's rules:
  only the owner's first workspace, verified email, not a repeat signup
  (`rewards_available` in the overview says whether they apply).

  422 when already claimed, not reached yet, or not eligible, with the
  reason as `message`. Requires `run.view`.

  Response is wrapped: `{ success, statusCode, message, data: { credits, getting_started } }`.
}
